{"id":140301670,"slug":"rapid-acting-mental-health-treatment","title":"Rapid Acting Mental Health Treatment is Here...Are You Ready?","subtitle":"Celebrate the arrival of things that work fast!","post_date":"2024-01-03T03:26:44.730Z","audience":"everyone","type":"newsletter","canonical_url":"https://thefrontierpsychiatrists.substack.com/p/rapid-acting-mental-health-treatment","wordcount":423,"source":"api","fetched_at":"2026-09-13T21:55:14.524Z","body_sha256":"40517b246a973d0f58f3a65f73070ff57c372a24613e60fbef022e1844626eb1","text_words":428,"complete":true,"body_html":"<p><strong>The Frontier Psychiatrists</strong> is a newsletter and a stealth media empire.  We have—that was the royal we—grown into a movement with our first in-person event coming up this Sunday.  YES.  In San Francisco!  This Sunday, Jan 7th!  6-9 pm.</p><p>First Off, <a href=\"https://www.eventbrite.com/e/rapid-acting-mental-health-treatment-2024-tickets-745564622857?aff=oddtdtcreator\">Tickets are still available.</a></p><p>This has been your tremendous growth for the Frontier Psychiatrists, the 2nd leading health-satire publication (I think <a href=\"http://v\">outofpocket</a> is bigger by quite a bit!)</p><p>We are holding our event right in advance of the JPM Healthcare Conference!  The point is to generate FOMO.  I imagine the conversation going as follows in my head…cause you know, I am such a big shot…</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!0R_p!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F0ff2924a-3be6-4a26-b5d9-2704b32bf2ae_1290x1704.jpeg\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!0R_p!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F0ff2924a-3be6-4a26-b5d9-2704b32bf2ae_1290x1704.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!0R_p!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F0ff2924a-3be6-4a26-b5d9-2704b32bf2ae_1290x1704.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!0R_p!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F0ff2924a-3be6-4a26-b5d9-2704b32bf2ae_1290x1704.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!0R_p!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F0ff2924a-3be6-4a26-b5d9-2704b32bf2ae_1290x1704.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!0R_p!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F0ff2924a-3be6-4a26-b5d9-2704b32bf2ae_1290x1704.jpeg\" width=\"1290\" height=\"1704\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/0ff2924a-3be6-4a26-b5d9-2704b32bf2ae_1290x1704.jpeg&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:1704,&quot;width&quot;:1290,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:234931,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/jpeg&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:true,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:null,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!0R_p!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F0ff2924a-3be6-4a26-b5d9-2704b32bf2ae_1290x1704.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!0R_p!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F0ff2924a-3be6-4a26-b5d9-2704b32bf2ae_1290x1704.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!0R_p!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F0ff2924a-3be6-4a26-b5d9-2704b32bf2ae_1290x1704.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!0R_p!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F0ff2924a-3be6-4a26-b5d9-2704b32bf2ae_1290x1704.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p></p><p>Owen:  “Wow, that's an excellent healthcare investment opportunity you mentioned!</p><p>…oh…<a href=\"https://www.fermata.health/news-updates/saint-stanford-intelligent-accelerated-neuromodulation-therapy\">Did you know depression can be in remission in 5 days?</a>”  <a href=\"https://www.magnusmed.com\">Magnus Medical</a> is changing brain medicine—<a href=\"https://thefrontierpsychiatrists.substack.com/p/ntap-means-saint-treatment-for-depression\">especially in inpatient settings</a>— with SAINT!”</p><p>Investor: “…”</p><p>Owen: “Of course, <a href=\"https://med.stanford.edu/profiles/nolan-williams?tab=proxy\">Nolan Williams</a> will be there.”</p><p>Investor: “…”</p><p>Owen: “Oh, or could you rapidly measure the change in depression using AI-enabled video capture with <a href=\"https://viderahealth.com\">Videra Health?</a>”</p><p>Investor: “…”</p><p>Owen: “Yes, it’s the <em>same</em> Videra Health who works with my team at <a href=\"https://www.irxreminder.com\">iRxReminder</a> to measure symptoms of<a href=\"https://open.substack.com/pub/thefrontierpsychiatrists/p/that-time-i-did-not-disagree-with?r=1ct8f&amp;utm_campaign=post&amp;utm_medium=web\"> Tardive Dyskinesia</a> for <a href=\"https://www.irxreminder.com/news/article/phase-ii-nih-grant-awarded/649/\">NIH-funded TDetect.</a>”</p><p>Investor: “…”</p><p>Owen: “I know…it’s been a time of remarkable change.  Of course, the field was pioneered by <a href=\"https://nightware.com\">Nightware</a>, who have a medical device—yes, running inside a proprietary Apple Watch—that treats nightmare disorder—yes, using AI.  Yes, It improves symptoms with an effect size of 0.88.”</p><p>Investor: “…”</p><p>Owen: “It’s crucial in veterans. And others with PTSD!”</p><p>Investor: “…”</p><p>Owen: “That is a crucial point….First Responders need it, too.  Have you met Kalli Ortega from the <a href=\"https://www.meleosgroup.com\">Meleos Group</a>?  They will explain the impact on secondary insurance markets, Disability policies, and workers’s comp insurance.” </p><p>Investor: “…”</p><p>Owen: “These are crucial questions.  Michelle Bernabe, RN addresses these issues regularly in her <span class=\"mention-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Moral Health&quot;,&quot;id&quot;:77106,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;pub&quot;,&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://open.substack.com/pub/moralhealth&quot;,&quot;photo_url&quot;:&quot;https://bucketeer-e05bbc84-baa3-437e-9518-adb32be77984.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/2f672c3e-1261-4f60-b1c7-7db0be547281_1280x1280.png&quot;,&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;e9358400-27d2-4fc6-b7bc-f81bbe853972&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"MentionToDOM\"></span> publication.”</p><p>Investor: “…”</p><p>Owen: “I agree.  It's why we partnered with <a href=\"https://www.brainfutures.org/\">BrainFutures</a> as a 501c3 nonprofit organization for the event.”</p><p>Investor: “…”</p><p>Owen: “We will include researchers like <a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/sharenarice?utm_source=share&amp;utm_campaign=share_via&amp;utm_content=profile&amp;utm_medium=ios_app\">Sharena Rice</a> Ph.D. And <a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/danielleddesouza?utm_source=share&amp;utm_campaign=share_via&amp;utm_content=profile&amp;utm_medium=ios_app\">Danielle De’Souza, Ph.D</a> talking about the rapid changes happening in research on non-invasive brain medicine right now at <a href=\"https://www.acaciaclinics.com/\">Acacia Clinics</a>.</p><p>Investor: “…!…”</p><p>Owen: I know!  Also, <a href=\"https://www.fermata.health/#founders\">Carlene MacMillan</a>, M.D. will keep my head on straight.  Did you know she went to Harvard before working at <a href=\"https://www.osmind.org/about/carlene-macmillan\">Osmind</a>?  I did.  She loves a good bird-shaped cocktail!</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Dw0N!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F248dc474-2fa0-4288-8067-37ce3028881f_4032x3024.jpeg\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Dw0N!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F248dc474-2fa0-4288-8067-37ce3028881f_4032x3024.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Dw0N!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F248dc474-2fa0-4288-8067-37ce3028881f_4032x3024.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Dw0N!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F248dc474-2fa0-4288-8067-37ce3028881f_4032x3024.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Dw0N!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F248dc474-2fa0-4288-8067-37ce3028881f_4032x3024.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Dw0N!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F248dc474-2fa0-4288-8067-37ce3028881f_4032x3024.jpeg\" width=\"1456\" height=\"1941\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/248dc474-2fa0-4288-8067-37ce3028881f_4032x3024.jpeg&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:1941,&quot;width&quot;:1456,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:2589890,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/jpeg&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,