6712f29112_4032x3024.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" loading=\"lazy\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>Investor: “No!!!!”</p><div><hr></div><p>This is the kind of obnoxious conversation I'm having in my head right now.  Join us!</p><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://thefrontierpsychiatrists.substack.com/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Subscribe now&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://thefrontierpsychiatrists.substack.com/subscribe?\"><span>Subscribe now</span></a></p><p></p><p></p><p></p>","text":"The Frontier Psychiatrists is a newsletter and a stealth media empire. We have—that was the royal we—grown into a movement with our first in-person event coming up this Sunday. YES. In San Francisco! This Sunday, Jan 7th! 6-9 pm.\n\nFirst Off, Tickets are still available.\n\nThis has been your tremendous growth for the Frontier Psychiatrists, the 2nd leading health-satire publication (I think outofpocket is bigger by quite a bit!)\n\nWe are holding our event right in advance of the JPM Healthcare Conference! The point is to generate FOMO. I imagine the conversation going as follows in my head…cause you know, I am such a big shot…\n\nOwen: “Wow, that's an excellent healthcare investment opportunity you mentioned!\n\n…oh… Did you know depression can be in remission in 5 days? ” Magnus Medical is changing brain medicine— especially in inpatient settings — with SAINT!”\n\nInvestor: “…”\n\nOwen: “Of course, Nolan Williams will be there.”\n\nInvestor: “…”\n\nOwen: “Oh, or could you rapidly measure the change in depression using AI-enabled video capture with Videra Health? ”\n\nInvestor: “…”\n\nOwen: “Yes, it’s the same Videra Health who works with my team at iRxReminder to measure symptoms of Tardive Dyskinesia for NIH-funded TDetect. ”\n\nInvestor: “…”\n\nOwen: “I know…it’s been a time of remarkable change. Of course, the field was pioneered by Nightware , who have a medical device—yes, running inside a proprietary Apple Watch—that treats nightmare disorder—yes, using AI. Yes, It improves symptoms with an effect size of 0.88.”\n\nInvestor: “…”\n\nOwen: “It’s crucial in veterans. And others with PTSD!”\n\nInvestor: “…”\n\nOwen: “That is a crucial point….First Responders need it, too. Have you met Kalli Ortega from the Meleos Group ? They will explain the impact on secondary insurance markets, Disability policies, and workers’s comp insurance.”\n\nInvestor: “…”\n\nOwen: “These are crucial questions. Michelle Bernabe, RN addresses these issues regularly in her publication.”\n\nInvestor: “…”\n\nOwen: “I agree. It's why we partnered with BrainFutures as a 501c3 nonprofit organization for the event.”\n\nInvestor: “…”\n\nOwen: “We will include researchers like Sharena Rice Ph.D. And Danielle De’Souza, Ph.D talking about the rapid changes happening in research on non-invasive brain medicine right now at Acacia Clinics .\n\nInvestor: “…!…”\n\nOwen: I know! Also, Carlene MacMillan , M.D. will keep my head on straight. Did you know she went to Harvard before working at Osmind ? I did. She loves a good bird-shaped cocktail!\n\nInvestor: “?”\n\nOwen: “No, Quinn can’t make it. Too busy.”\n\nInvestor: “No!!!!”\n\nThis is the kind of obnoxious conversation I'm having in my head right now. Join us!\n\nSubscribe now"}